1) New Empty Python Project with a fresh Environment

2) Install Django
pip install django

3) Start the Django Project
django-admin startproject LibraryDjango .

4) python manage.py runserver

5) Admin Panel
127.0.0.1:8000/admin

6)
python manage.py makemigrations (jb b koi change krna models me)
python manage.py migrate (us change ko db me reflect krna)

7)
python manage.py createsuperuser

8) Create an app
python manage.py startapp core

